# Layout of Tante's C++ code (ADR-0001 point 3,
# docs/adr/0001-cpp20-cmake-vcpkg-guardrails.md): Google style, as the
# coding guideline's naming is, with lines up to 100 characters. CI fails when
# a file differs from what clang-format would write: docs/development.md#clang-format
BasedOnStyle: Google
ColumnLimit: 100
